A proven research, publication and teaching track record and the ability to create an environment in which research, teaching and learning activities are supported and can flourish;
Ability to manage the Faculty and provide sound academic leadership;
Ability to provide strong leadership and the capacity to lead the Faculty on the journey that it has already embarked upon with regard to curriculum transformation; and
Excellent communication and appropriate language skills.
