To produce markers in the most accurate and cost effective manner in line with the production critical path;
Prioritise styles for grading in line with production plan;
Liaising with the Department Head.
Marker Maker
Responsible for timeous and accurate preparation of markers for cutting. Markers must be production friendly and ensuring best possible rating achieved. Assist with the accurate preparation of print and position markers for bulk garment production.
TECHNICAL KNOWLEDGE
Timeous and accurate preparation of markers ensuring best possible rating;
Adhere to standard best practice for fabric quality Laying-Up standards i.e. Lay lengths and Fabric Supplies;
Checking fabric widths for each style prior to preparing marker and preparing marker accordingly - check border prints, all over prints and stripes;
